# Personal CV source. Authored here, copied into both images at build time by
# docker/php/Dockerfile (COPY CV/*.md) and docker/next/Dockerfile (COPY CV/*.pdf).
# Not committed: these carry phone number, email and full employment history.
#
# Consequence: a fresh clone has no CV files, and both COPY globs match zero
# files, which is a hard build error. Supply them out of band before building.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
